# `packages/db/` was deleted in b9d491b7, but biome check --write keeps
# re-adding this line (it syncs the ignore list against what it sees on disk).
# Leaving it out is deliberate: with the rule present, the 56 generated Prisma
# client files still sitting in the working tree show up as untracked noise.
# Delete the leftover directory to make that permanent.
#
# `.moon/` used to be ignored wholesale, which made the ENTIRE task graph
# untracked. That is why the moon 1.x -> 2.x breakage survived the migration
# unnoticed: the configs that never parsed were not in version control at all.
# The task configs must be committed; only the cache is generated.
.moon/cache/

# TanStack Router generates this from src/routes on every build.
# Committing it would make every route change produce a second diff hunk and
# merge conflicts on a machine-written file.
apps/frontend/src/routeTree.gen.ts
